{"version":1,"page":{"kind":"gloss-detail","href":"/shijing/gloss/026-bai-zhou/chenhuan-chuanshu/0002-1","dataHref":"/__data/shijing/gloss/026-bai-zhou/chenhuan-chuanshu/0002-1/data.json","title":"詩毛氏傳疏 · 汎彼柏舟，亦汎其流。耿耿不寐，如有隱憂。微我無酒，以遨以遊。我心匪鑒，不可以茹。亦有兄弟，不可以據。薄言往愬，逢彼之怒。我心匪石，不可轉也。我心匪席，不可卷也。威儀棣棣，不可選也。憂心悄悄，慍于群小。覯閔既多，受侮不少。靜言思之，寤辟有摽。日居月諸，胡迭而微？心之憂矣，如匪澣衣。靜言思之，不能奮飛。 · 陈奂 · 疏","description":"風 · 邶風 · 柏舟 · 《詩毛氏傳疏》关于“汎彼柏舟，亦汎其流。耿耿不寐，如有隱憂。微我無酒…”的注脚：陈奂遵《序》旧说，把《柏舟》解释为仁臣当衛頃公之世而遭谗不遇之辞。其疏先以柏木坚致、舟流中河比贤者操守孤立，继而将“兄弟不可据”“逢彼之怒”“愠…"},"payload":{"detail":{"route":{"poemId":"026-bai-zhou","materialId":"chenhuan-chuanshu","glossId":"0002-1"},"href":"/shijing/gloss/026-bai-zhou/chenhuan-chuanshu/0002-1","poem":{"id":"026-bai-zhou","title":"柏舟","categoryId":"feng","subcategoryId":"beifeng","path":["風","邶風","柏舟"],"segments":[{"id":"seg-001","text":"汎彼柏舟","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-002","text":"亦汎其流","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-003","text":"耿耿不寐","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-004","text":"如有隱憂","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-005","text":"微我無酒","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-006","text":"以遨以遊","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-007","text":"我心匪鑒","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-008","text":"不可以茹","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-009","text":"亦有兄弟","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-010","text":"不可以據","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-011","text":"薄言往愬","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-012","text":"逢彼之怒","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-013","text":"我心匪石","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-014","text":"不可轉也","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-015","text":"我心匪席","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-016","text":"不可卷也","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-017","text":"威儀棣棣","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-018","text":"不可選也","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-019","text":"憂心悄悄","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-020","text":"慍于群小","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-021","text":"覯閔既多","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-022","text":"受侮不少","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-023","text":"靜言思之","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-024","text":"寤辟有摽","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-025","text":"日居月諸","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-026","text":